The packaged native-order MoE files and G2 slot epilogue are adapted from
ROCm/aiter commit 4ad99832823dde2315b361cbd3b54b1c5c12acd5,
aiter/ops/flydsl/kernels/moe_2stage_a16wmix and kernels/act.py.
Their Apache-2.0 / FlyDSL Project Contributors notices remain in the source.
Modifications preserve native K32 ordering, isolate generated symbols and
write unweighted BF16 per-slot G2 output for the original Muse finalizer.

prefill_qkv_layout.py is adapted from AITER's Triton GEMM-A16W16 kernel;
prefill_maxscale.py and aiter-swa-stage2.patch are adapted from AITER's
unified-attention implementation at the same revision. The attention
source retains its upstream vLLM attribution. Changes implement direct
rank-major QKV output, native-rounding max-before-scale, and a bounded
SWA pipeline-stage selection, respectively.

